Company updates and more.. 
 ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌

Hi there,

Maddie here from Originality.AI!

Today I wanted to share a few company updates with you! 

* Our Challenge to OpenAI ( or anyone who thinks AI detectors are BS) 

* Our most recent study that found more than 30% of Capterra Reviews are
AI-Generated!! 

* Meet us at Content Marketing World in Washington DC next week! 

* Upcoming Webinar- Register your team! 

**1. We challenged OpenAI with AI Detection Efficacy Challenge with
Proceeds Going to Charity**

In response to recent statements by OpenAI regarding the efficacy of AI
detectors, we've  launched a challenge to them ( or anyone else
claiming that AI detection is BS) with all proceeds going to charity. We
think it's totally irresponsible for OpenAI to be making such claims
with zero empirical evidence. 

We firmly believe that AI Content Detectors play a crucial role in
addressing societal concerns related to undetectable AI-generated
content-  including mass propaganda, the proliferation of fake news,
fabricated reviews, academic misconduct, and the spread of non-factual,
inaccurate information.

The challenge aims to:

* Educate the public about the accuracy and limitations of AI detectors

* Create an enjoyable and engaging initiative

* Contribute to a worthwhile charitable cause

For more information on how to participate in the challenge read here:
https://jonhaver.acemlnb.com/lt.php?s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1984A2146A61A30506

If you are a journalist and would like to cover this challenge, please
reach out to me! 

Let's see if OpenAI is up for our challenge! 

**2.Study Finds More than 30% of Capterra Reviews are AI-Generated Since
Launch of ChatGPT**

Our team recently conducted an in-depth study
analyzing
29,000 reviews on Capterra, a platform for B2B software reviews. The
study aimed to determine the prevalence of AI-generated reviews since
the launch of ChatGPT. 

**Here are the key findings! **

* More than 30% of reviews on Capterra since the launch of ChatGPT are
likely to be AI-generated, representing a 

****224% increase****

* High ratings of 4 and 5 were 2.1 times more likely to have
AI-generated reviews

* We tracked the percentage of AI-generated reviews over time and
observed a significant spike after ChatGPT became available on November
30, 2022

* Note that the ~5% of reviews that were identified as AI generated
before 2020 represent false positives that occur with AI detectors

Read Full Study Here!

Like our study from last weeks update which highlighted the prevalence
of AI-Generated Amazon Reviews,
we believe
that these findings prompt some thought provoking questions about the
use of AI-generated content in online reviews.

Do AI-Generated Reviews add some additional challenges and risks for
individuals and businesses relying on them for decision-making? Does
this impact the trustworthiness of these platforms? Is the concept of
the online review being poisoned by the prevalence of AI? 

The world of generative AI is still in its infancy, and its impact is
only beginning to be understood.

**3. Meet Us at Content Marketing World in Washington, DC**

Originality.AI will be a proud Sponsor and Exhibitor at Content
Marketing World in Washington, DC
next week.

This event is the perfect opportunity for us to connect with you in
person and share our latest news and features. 

If you are attending this conference we'd love to meet up with you!
Book a time slot with me here to connect in person. 

Book an in-Person Meeting at CMW

****Reminder ****

**Sign up for our next LIVE WEBINAR to get the most out of our tool!**

During this webinar, our Amazing Customer Success Agent, Brady, will
help show you how to best utilize Originality.AI to get the most out of
it. 

This is a unique opportunity to engage with us directly and gain
valuable insights into Originality.AI best practices. 

To register yourself or your team for the webinar, simply click
below and secure your spot today. 

Register for Our Next Webinar

Thanks for reading! 

  

